    "description": "GPU Acceleration, ML Adjacent Pipelines, High Performance Data Systems\n\n•\tPorted a production base calling pipeline from CPU to GPU, implementing custom CUDA kernels, optimizing memory transfer paths, and improving GPU/CPU concurrency to meet high throughput ML adjacent analysis requirements.\n•\tDesigned and optimized CUDA kernels across multiple stages of the analysis pipeline, improving inference throughput and reliability for large scale sequencing workloads.\n•\tOwned major components of the on instrument post primary analysis pipeline, producing customer facing metrics and BAM outputs at scale using distributed C++ services.\n•\tBuilt a real time feedback loop between analysis software and laser control systems, improving sequencing accuracy through ML adjacent signal modeling and adaptive control.\n•\tDeveloped a simulation based data integrity verification framework generating synthetic signals to validate ML driven analysis pipelines end to end.\n•\tCreated a regression detection framework integrated with CI to catch performance and accuracy regressions in ML adjacent analysis stages.\n•\tEnhanced internal R&D analysis pipelines for enzyme screening, enabling parameter sweeps, cluster execution, and rapid iteration on ML related algorithm development.\n•\tMaintained and improved distributed logging, data acquisition workflows, and cluster based analysis systems supporting both production and ML driven R&D workloads.\n",
